sequenceDiagram
    participant C as API Client
    participant G as Gateway Worker
    participant K as Edge KV
    participant I as Inference Routing Service
    participant P as External Model Provider
    C->>G: Request + bearer key
    G->>K: Look up key and route
    K-->>G: Edge configuration
    G->>I: Rewritten request
    I->>P: Call upstream
    P-->>I: Response stream
    I-->>G: Response stream
    G-->>C: Response stream
